288	  // Enables the vsim->QEMU handoff drain. After this is set, run() watches
289	  // committed PCs and on retire of a `csrw 0x7C0, *` exit-trigger drains
290	  // architectural state to `state_out_path` and returns kExitHandoffToQemu.
291	  //
